\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Inferred Fan Support Trajectories (Season 8).} Each triangle is a posterior heatmap of the weekly fan-share simplex (axes = placement 1/4/8): left corner = eventual \#1, right corner = eventual \#4, top corner = eventual \#8. Yellow indicates where posterior mass concentrates after conditioning on that week's elimination history; the mass drifting from the lower-right toward the bottom edge reflects a posterior update that moves away from \#8 (elimination risk) and shifts the implied outcome from \#4-like to \#1-like support.}}{8}{figure.caption.7}\protected@file@percent }
